>\n</span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;margin-top: 0px;\">\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;margin-top: 0px;\">\n<strong>\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;font-weight: bold;\">\n            品种：改良铁皮卡\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;font-weight: bold;\">\n            Typica Mejorada\n           </span>\n</span>\n</strong>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;margin-top: 0px;\">\n<strong>\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;font-weight: bold;\">\n            处理方式：日晒 Natural\n           </span>\n</span>\n</strong>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;margin-top: 0px;\">\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           采收处理：2025.6-9月\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;margin-top: 0px;\">\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           空运到港：2026.2\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;margin-top: 0px;\">\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           风味：花香、树莓、芒果、柚子\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;margin-top: 0px;\">\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           Floral, Raspberry, Mango, Pomelo\n          </span>\n</span>\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;margin-top: 0px;\">\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           第一次选到爱丽莎的果铁日晒，也是盲买的一个批次，但是超级好喝！（sorry请允许我又开始这么的草率粗暴的表达喝到它的喜悦）；王老师打样做了两个烘焙曲线，一个很芒果和柑橘，一个居然高温时第一感受是很细腻的花香和树莓，后来温度下来慢慢的向柑橘和芒果过渡一些，有意思，看来这个豆子可呈现的风味区间很大哟～\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;margin-top: 0px;\">\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;color: rgb(255, 104, 39);font-weight: bold;\">\n           特征关键词：花香+红色莓果+黄色热带水果+黄色柑橘\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;margin-top: 0px;\">\n<span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           处理方式简介：鲜果采收后进行浮选和清洗，接下来再进行一道人工筛选，在筛选后，进行预发酵，在22-26℃环境下氧化12小时，然后在发酵罐中23-27℃条件下发酵72小时，随后进行干燥，首先在户外遮阴高架床上预干燥3天，然后在环境条件可控的室内高架床上干燥28天，干燥期间环境温度24-40℃，相对湿度45-70%。最后，静置11周后脱壳，最终含水率达到10.8%左右。\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0em;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n           ‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0em;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;'>\n<span>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7Tia6593icv0lvf4dHREGOfbmAfP622IA0ctib7XLruCiaic1fylcq16UlTRsAfTqJ7ic2yrts31yszWxsw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-align: center;outline: 0px;width: 678px !important;visibility: visible !important;\"/>\n</span>\n<span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;color: rgb(178, 178, 178);font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n           洛哈在厄瓜多尔的南部\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;color: rgb(178, 178, 178);font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n           图片来源\n           <a class=\"normal_text_link\" data-linktype=\"2\" href=\"https://www.cafeimports.com/europe/ecuador\" linktype=\"text\" style=\"outline: 0px;cursor: pointer;\" target=\"_blank\" textvalue=\"\">\n            CAFE IMPORT\n           </a>\n</span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7SkB6M2kMYzk2Ea1BO4eOlaHn143rJWT4O90OO5FdoZiaTjOianhWibAefia23tt0bxAXdsk7wAVBMVtA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</section>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">\n<span>\n           Quilanga位于Loja省南部，与Gonzanama接壤\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>\n<span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<strong>\n<span>\n            关于养豆、储存和冲煮\n           </span>\n</strong>\n</span>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7SkB6M2kMYzk2Ea1BO4eOlaO8st3wWJAg8NrbKv0ymTtX1xo0yeJBml4nzPibBlPff0RqafqOu42FQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7SkB6M2kMYzk2Ea1BO4eOlajZ0qxia4sy1AmyTOCTwWo9icdSZb4AR6NO727rjxvdCVMQicHCBKdOONg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</section>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<strong>\n<span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</strong>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>\n<strong style=\"outline: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n            关于 爱丽莎农场 El Alisal\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n             ‍\n            </span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</strong>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.6em;text-align: justify;margin: 0px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n<span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-decoration: none;\">\n<span>\n           位于厄瓜多尔洛哈省基兰加县安第斯山脉坡地上，海拔2000米的Finca El Alisal不仅仅是一个咖啡种植场所，它是四代热情咖啡种植者传承的遗产的中心。农场里种植着Typica Nacional、Sidra、Typica Mejorada、瑰夏和Batian等品种；\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7SR9xz1aMKg8q8OicuvPONX4U7OiaTZpEqZ1JUb5HtkTKNkwPlxQgDkRHjdG18KhU6PflLpABXWibCRw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.6em;text-align: justify;margin: 0px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n<span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7SR9xz1aMKg8q8OicuvPONX4g9y4v5qw1pFayV7dUaDSLhJmZwtLYicwFkdtj7XRDVRGgTxfapVoyfg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.6em;text-align: justify;margin: 0px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n<span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-decoration: none;\">\n<span>\n           爱丽莎的经营哲学是对于可持续性和对环境的尊重，通过种植本地植物进行重新造林等举措，不仅寻求保护当地生物多样性和改善土壤和植物的健康，而且还有助于碳捕获，这是对抗气候变化的重要努力。这种全面的农业方法使的农场能够生产出真正可持续的咖啡，确保农场为后代仍然是一个生物多样性和自然美景的避风港。\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7SR9xz1aMKg8q8OicuvPONX4k7MQdB7chiaDGqIraJlYU4dIydsLYXkI0FjNxPwRwDhXice9sqWsicZAQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.6em;text-align: justify;margin: 0px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n<span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.6em;text-align: justify;margin: 0px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n<span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-decoration: none;\">\n<span>\n           与当地社区的合作也至关重要。通过与邻居们携手合作，不仅可以改善该地区的经济，而且分享知识共同成长。这种社区精神和合作精神使的大家能够共同迈向一个更有希望和可持续的未来。\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7SR9xz1aMKg8q8OicuvPONX4kkW7S5zw1zibUd5DFviazCwskKUclJlGoHW2tCwLDmD1yseibG6RgdW2w/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.6em;text-align: justify;margin: 0px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n<span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>\n<strong>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n            获奖记录\n           </span>\n</span>\n</strong>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n           2023 CoE#9\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n           2022 CoE#12\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0em;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;'>\n<span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;\">\n<span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0em;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans 